WEBVTT

00:00:00.104 --> 00:00:05.764
Starting a conversation

00:00:05.814 --> 00:00:09.442
Open Messages in the sidebar and press New Message.

00:00:19.462 --> 00:00:23.535
Open the To box, search for a name and pick the person.

00:00:32.226 --> 00:00:36.085
Add a subject if you like, then type your message.

00:00:49.573 --> 00:00:54.301
Press Send Message. The conversation opens on the right.

00:00:56.964 --> 00:01:01.635
Message sent
